  "alt_title": "환생했더니 대공의 셋째 아들 | Reincarnated as the Archduke’s Son | Reencarnado como o terceiro filho do Grão-Duque | A Mercenary's Rebirth Among Nobles | Reencarné como el tercer hijo del gran duque | Reincarnated as the Archduke's Third Son | Reinkarniert als der dritte Sohn des Herzogs | 元傭兵団長、大公家の三男に転生する~才能と家柄ですべてを蹂躙する最強貴族ライフ~ | 轉生為大公家的三兒子 | 转世成为公爵家的三儿子 | 환생했더니 대공이 셋째 아들 | Reincarnated as the Grand Duke's Third Son | I Reincarnated as the Archduke's Third Son | Reincarnated As The Grand Dukes Third Son | Status",
